    "masking_description": "\"Blinding of patients and physicians is not possible due to different types of oral anticoagulant therapy within the same interventional arm and the need for continuous monitoring of treatment with warfarin.However, since the primary outcome is not a subjectively reported outcome, lack of blinding presents less risk of bias.~The investigators responsible for data collection and the Endpoint Adjudication Committee will be blinded to the randomization.\"",
